  "bodyHtml": "\n\n\t\n\t\t<div class=\"archive-header\">\n\n\t<h1 class=\"archive-title\">Paul Hammersten</h1>\n\n\t\n\t\n</div>\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-3817 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-meet-the-artist category-the-gallery category-gallery-artists category-news tag-cape-cod tag-cape-cod-art-galleries tag-cape-cod-artist tag-harwich-ma tag-harwich-port tag-meet-the-artist tag-paul-hammersten tag-the-art-gallery-of-the-guild-of-harwich-artists\" id=\"post-3817\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/june-09-meet-the-artist/\"><img class=\"landscape cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"395\" height=\"296\" alt=\"When the spirit tells my story of the cygnine.\" src=\"/media/archive/4eb263ed6631e879a24a2a32898c58ff4bf1160fd0a7b98325ca13fa3a6db570.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/june-09-meet-the-artist/\" rel=\"bookmark\">June 9 Meet The Artist</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2018-06-04T23:58:40-04:00\" title=\"Monday, June 4, 2018, 11:58 pm\">June 4, 2018</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>Master Artist Paul Hammersten will be at The Art Gallery of the Guild of Harwich Artists on Saturday, June 9 from 10 AM to 4 PM to share the story <a href=\"/news/june-09-meet-the-artist/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-3726 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-the-gallery category-gallery-artists category-news tag-crazy-horse-memorial-foundation tag-paul-hammersten tag-the-art-gallery-of-the-guild-of-harwich-artists\" id=\"post-3726\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/hammerstens-attending-crazy-horse-memorial-foundation-event/\"><img class=\"portrait cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"375\" height=\"500\" alt=\"Two people standing in front of a large rock face.\" src=\"/media/archive/6a2b925c807a1d4796a9f291d23384afdf1704c8dc20f9f42afe86caa8827baa.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/hammerstens-attending-crazy-horse-memorial-foundation-event/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Hammerstens Attending Crazy Horse Memorial Foundation Event</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2018-04-25T01:02:06-04:00\" title=\"Wednesday, April 25, 2018, 1:02 am\">April 25, 2018</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>Sharon and Paul Hammersten will be attending the Crazy Horse Memorial Foundation Private Insider’s Event in Boston/Marlborough, MA on Saturday, May 5th. Sharon and Paul are longstanding members of The <a href=\"/news/hammerstens-attending-crazy-horse-memorial-foundation-event/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-3347 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-education category-events category-meet-the-artist category-the-gallery category-gallery-artists category-news tag-meet-the-artist tag-paul-hammersten tag-the-art-gallery-of-the-guild-of-harwich-artists\" id=\"post-3347\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/meet-the-artist-september-23/\"><img class=\"landscape cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"559\" height=\"500\" alt=\"Paul Hammersten\" src=\"/media/archive/610a20ce38cf3447fbecf8794c6e278500200a16243fa8cf3d3563b219a28447.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/meet-the-artist-september-23/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Meet The Artist September 23</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2017-09-14T01:09:17-04:00\" title=\"Thursday, September 14, 2017, 1:09 am\">September 14, 2017</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>Drop by and hear artist Paul Hammersten read from one of his five new books throughout the day on Saturday, September, 23 from 10:00 AM to 4:00 PM. Each book <a href=\"/news/meet-the-artist-september-23/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\t\n",
